{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3ff93ccd-c8b4-84d4-9ea1-f6057689731b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T11:27:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:23:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:23:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes. I would like to report a noise problem. A noise... complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:24:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I can help get that started. Can you tell me a little about what's happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:24:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My neighbor plays loud music. Very loud. Every weekend. And it has been going on since last Thursday, so, well, that is not even the weekend, but that is when it began."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:24:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So it started last Thursday, and it's been loud music from the neighbor. Has it been going on at the same times each day, or does it vary?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies. Afternoons, and then into the night. The bass, mostly. The bass comes through the wall. Through the floor, almost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:24:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Hold on one moment, I'm going to open the form so I can take this down properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:24:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. I am, ah, having my own trouble here. My mouse stopped working, so I am using the, the trackpad. And I am very, very bad at the trackpad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:24:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no worries, you don't need a computer for this, I'm just writing it up on my end. Okay. What's the address where you're calling from, where the noise is being heard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "96 Rhode Island Avenue. Ninety-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "96 Rhode Island Avenue. And that's up in the Historic Hill area, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Samir Cohen. C-O-H-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Samir Cohen. Got it. Do you know which house the music is coming from? Is it next door, or across the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next door. The house on the left, as you face the street. I do not know the name. I only know the music."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, we can work with the address. Do you know the number, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ninety-four, I believe. Ninety-four. I am fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put down 94, and note that you're fairly sure. Has anyone called the police about it, or is this the first report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have not called anyone. This is the first. I wanted it on record. A report, taken. That is what I want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll take the report now. I have it as loud music, mostly weekends, starting last Thursday, afternoons into the night, with heavy bass coming through the shared wall. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is right. Exactly right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what's a good number to reach you, in case someone follows up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0161. That is the landline. I am home most days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0161. Let me read that back. Four oh one, five five five, oh one six one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So the report will be logged and passed along to the right office. If it happens again tonight, or tomorrow with the holiday coming, you may want to also call the police non-emergency line so there's a record at the time of the noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tonight. Yes, it is New Year's Eve. I suspect it will be... worse. But I understand. The non-emergency line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Is there anything else I can note down for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:27:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all. Thank you for taking it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:27:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cohen. Take care, and happy New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
